<body>
<header><div class="brand"><span class="mark">FBC</span><div><strong>Friga Basketball Club</strong><small>Parent texting workspace</small></div></div><span class="pill">Owner workspace</span></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR IPHONE. YOUR NUMBER.</div><h1>One message.<br /><span>Separate conversations.</span></h1><p>Choose parents, write your text, and review every recipient. Send from your iPhone, never into a group chat.</p></div><div class="source"><strong id="directory-count">0</strong><span>verified parent numbers</span><div id="source-date">Loading your saved snapshot...</div></div></section>
<div class="notice" id="initial-notice"><strong>Start with your own number.</strong> Test one message before contacting families. This website does not send by itself or read Messages. No messages have been sent by this page.</div>
<div class="columns"><section class="card"><h2><span class="step">1</span> Choose your parents</h2>
<div class="filters"><label class="field">Search<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Parent, player or number" autocomplete="off" /></label><label class="field">Grade<select id="grade"><option value="all">All grades</option></select></label></div>
<div class="toolbar"><button id="select-visible" type="button">Select visible</button><button id="clear" class="link" type="button">Clear selection</button></div><div id="contacts" class="contacts" aria-label="Verified parent numbers"></div><p class="small" id="visible-count"></p>
<details class="manual"><summary>Paste numbers / test your own number</summary><label class="field">One US or Canada number per line<textarea id="manual" rows="3" placeholder="(330) 555-0123" autocomplete="off"></textarea></label><p class="small">Only use adult recipients who agreed to your texts. Pasted numbers are not saved to your master database. Duplicates are removed.</p></details>
<details class="blocked"><summary>Do-not-contact list on this device</summary><label class="field">One number per line<textarea id="blocked" rows="3" placeholder="Add numbers that asked not to be contacted"></textarea></label><button id="save-blocked" type="button">Save exclusions</button><p class="small">Applied to selections and pasted numbers. Saved only in this browser, not synced with your master database. Record opt-outs there too.</p></details>
</section>
<div><section class="card"><h2><span class="step">2</span> Write one message</h2><div class="templates"><button type="button" data-template="training">Training reminder</button><button type="button" data-template="update">Club update</button><button type="button" data-template="test">Test message</button></div>
<label class="field">Same message for everyone selected<textarea id="message" maxlength="2000" rows="6" placeholder="FBC: Write your message here. - Coach Luke"></textarea></label><div class="under"><span class="small" id="characters">0 / 2,000 characters</span><span class="small">Replies stay in Messages</span></div><p class="small">Do not include an individual child's payment status or private details in a multi-parent message. Replace any [placeholders] before reviewing.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2><span class="step">3</span> Choose how to send</h2>
<label class="mode"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="manual" checked /><span><strong>Send one by one in Messages</strong><small>No Shortcut setup. Copy your text, open each person, paste, and tap Send on your iPhone.</small></span></label>
<label class="mode"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="shortcut" /><span><strong>Send a batch with Apple Shortcuts</strong><small>One reviewed handoff. Requires the installed and tested FBC Individual Texts shortcut. Not simultaneous.</small></span></label>
<label class="check" id="shortcut-ready-wrap" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="shortcut-ready" /><span>I created and tested <strong>FBC Individual Texts</strong> on this iPhone. Its Send Message action uses only <strong>Repeat Item</strong> as the recipient.</span></label>
<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="consent" /><span>I checked the recipients and message, have their permission to text, and excluded anyone who asked not to be contacted.</span></label>
<details class="setup" id="setup"><summary>One-time batch Shortcut setup</summary><p class="small">The website cannot install this for you. In Apple's Shortcuts app, create a shortcut named exactly <strong>FBC Individual Texts</strong>.</p><ol>
<li><strong>Get Dictionary from Input</strong>, using <strong>Shortcut Input</strong>. Add <strong>Set Variable</strong> named <strong>Batch</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Get Dictionary Value</strong>: key <code>schema</code>, dictionary <strong>Batch</strong>. If it is not <code>fbc.iphone-text.v1</code>, show an alert and <strong>Stop This Shortcut</strong>. End If.</li>
<li><strong>Get Dictionary Value</strong>: key <code>preview</code>, dictionary <strong>Batch</strong>. <strong>Show Alert</strong> with that value. Keep <strong>Show Cancel Button</strong> on. This is the final approval before sending.</li>
<li><strong>Get Dictionary Value</strong>: key <code>message</code>, dictionary <strong>Batch</strong>. <strong>Set Variable</strong> named <strong>Message</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Get Dictionary Value</strong>: key <code>recipients</code>, dictionary <strong>Batch</strong>. Add <strong>Repeat with Each</strong> for that list.</li>
<li>Inside Repeat, <strong>Send Message</strong>: text <strong>Message</strong>, recipient <strong>Repeat Item only</strong>. Never use the whole list. End Repeat.</li>
<li>Keep <strong>Show When Run</strong> on for the first test to your own number. After testing, you may turn it off; iOS may still ask permission. Keep the final review alert.</li></ol><p class="small">Check your personal number in Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Messages &gt; Send &amp; Receive. With multiple phone lines, verify the sending line. Your phone chooses iMessage, RCS or SMS as available; this is not an SMS-only service.</p><p class="small"><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/shortcuts/run-a-shortcut-from-a-url-apd624386f42/ios" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple's Shortcut handoff instructions</a></p></details>
</section></div></div>
<footer class="small"><strong>Your data stays out of the public code repository.</strong> This page uses a saved contact snapshot, not a live connection to your master database. Browser-only changes from another device are not included. Never turn off the site's access protection while family data is loaded. No delivery tracking, scheduled sends or automatic reply handling.<div class="data-actions"><button id="resume" hidden type="button">Resume reviewed queue</button><button id="forget" type="button">Clear this session's draft and queue</button></div><p id="last-status" role="status"></p></footer>
</main>
<div class="sticky"><div class="sticky-inner"><div><strong id="selected-count">0 people selected</strong><small id="readiness">Choose recipients and write your message.</small></div><button id="review" class="accent" type="button" disabled>Review messages</button></div></div>
<dialog id="review-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"><button id="close-dialog" class="close" type="button" aria-label="Close review">Close</button><div id="dialog-content"></div></dialog>
<div id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
<script is:inline id="fbc-snapshot" type="application/json" set:html={boot}></script>
<script is:inline>
(() => {
'use strict';
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const normalize=v=>{const s=String(v??'').trim();if(!/^\+?[\d\s().-]+$/.test(s))return null;let n=s.replace(/\D/g,'');if(n.length===11&&n[0]==='1')n=n.slice(1);return /^[2-9]\d{2}[2-9]\d{6}$/.test(n)?'+1'+n:null;};
const format=v=>{const n=String(v).replace(/^\+1/,'');return '('+n.slice(0,3)+') '+n.slice(3,6)+'-'+n.slice(6);};
const LIMIT=25, KEY='fbc-texts-v1-session', BLOCKKEY='fbc-texts-v1-exclusions';
const data=JSON.parse($('#fbc-snapshot').textContent), directory=(data.contacts||[]).filter(c=>normalize(c.phone)), selected=new Set(), handedOff=new Set();
let mode='manual', queue=null, reviewed=null, copied=false, opened=false, timer, localBlocked=[], storageWarning=false;
const load=(store,key)=>{try{return JSON.parse(store.getItem(key)||'null');}catch{return null;}};
try{localBlocked=load(localStorage,BLOCKKEY)||[];}catch{}
if(!Array.isArray(localBlocked))localBlocked=[];
$('#blocked').value=localBlocked.join('\n');
function notify(t){$('#toast').textContent=t;$('#toast').hidden=false;clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').hidden=true,6500);}
function save(){try{sessionStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify({message:$('#message').value,manual:$('#manual').value,selected:[...selected],queue}));}catch{if(!storageWarning){storageWarning=true;$('#last-status').textContent='This browser cannot save your queue. Keep this page open; refreshing may lose progress.';}}}
function blocked(){return new Set([...(data.blocked||[]),...localBlocked].map(normalize).filter(Boolean));}
function visible(){const q=$('#search').value.trim().toLowerCase(),g=$('#grade').value,b=blocked();return directory.filter(c=>!b.has(c.phone)&&(g==='all'||c.grades.includes(g))&&(!q||[...c.names,...c.players,c.phone].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q)||(/^\d{4,}$/.test(q)&&c.phone.includes(q))));}
function recipients(){const b=blocked(),allowed=new Set(directory.map(c=>c.phone));let list=[...selected].filter(n=>allowed.has(n)&&!b.has(n)),invalid=[],excluded=[];$('#manual').value.split(/\r?\n/).forEach((v,i)=>{if(!v.trim())return;const n=normalize(v);if(!n)invalid.push(i+1);else if(b.has(n))excluded.push(i+1);else list.push(n);});return{phones:[...new Set(list)],invalid,excluded};}
function invalidate(){reviewed=null;$('#consent').checked=false;update();save();}
function renderContacts(){const rows=visible();$('#contacts').innerHTML=rows.map(c=>`<label class="contact"><input type="checkbox" data-phone="${esc(c.phone)}" ${selected.has(c.phone)?'checked':''} /><span><strong>${esc(c.names.join(' / ')||'Verified guardian')}</strong><small>${esc(c.players.join(' / '))}</small><small class="phone">${esc(format(c.phone))}</small></span></label>`).join('')||'<p class="small">No verified numbers match. Change the filter or paste an adult number below.</p>';$('#visible-count').textContent=rows.length+' shown. Shared family numbers appear once. Limit: '+LIMIT+' per batch.';}
function check(){const r=recipients(),message=$('#message').value.trim();let error='';if(r.invalid.length)error='Fix number lines: '+r.invalid.join(', ')+'.';else if(r.excluded.length)error='Remove excluded number lines: '+r.excluded.join(', ')+'.';else if(r.phones.length>LIMIT)error='Select no more than '+LIMIT+' people.';else if(!r.phones.length)error='Choose at least one recipient.';else if(!message)error='Write your message.';else if(message.length>2000)error='Keep the message under 2,001 characters.';else if(/\[[^\]]+\]/.test(message))error='Replace the [placeholders] in your message.';else if(!$('#consent').checked)error='Confirm recipient permission and review.';else if(mode==='shortcut'&&!$('#shortcut-ready').checked)error='Complete and test the Shortcut setup first.';return{...r,message,error};}
function update(){const r=check();$('#selected-count').textContent=r.phones.length+' '+(r.phones.length===1?'person':'people')+' selected';$('#characters').textContent=$('#message').value.length+' / 2,000 characters';$('#readiness').textContent=r.error||(mode==='manual'?'You approve each send in Messages.':'Ready to review the Shortcut handoff.');$('#review').disabled=!!r.error;$('#shortcut-ready-wrap').hidden=mode!=='shortcut';$('#resume').hidden=!queue||queue.index>=queue.phones.length;}
function preview(t){return '<textarea class="preview" id="approved-message" readonly aria-label="Reviewed message">'+esc(t)+'</textarea>';}
function payload(batch){return{schema:'fbc.iphone-text.v1',batchId:Date.now().toString(36),message:batch.message,recipients:batch.phones,count:batch.phones.length,preview:'Send '+batch.phones.length+' separate messages?\n\n'+batch.phones.map(format).join('\n')+'\n\n'+batch.message+'\n\nCancel if anything is incorrect.'};}
function review(){const r=check();if(r.error){notify(r.error);return;}reviewed={phones:[...r.phones],message:r.message,mode};$('#dialog-content').innerHTML='<div class="eyebrow">FINAL REVIEW / NOT SENT</div><h2 id="dialog-title">'+r.phones.length+' separate conversation'+(r.phones.length===1?'':'s')+'</h2>'+preview(r.message)+'<details open><summary>All recipient numbers</summary><div class="recipient-review">'+r.phones.map(n=>{const c=directory.find(c=>c.phone===n);return esc(format(n)+(c?' - '+c.names.join(' / '):' - Pasted number'));}).join('\n')+'</div></details><p class="small">'+(mode==='manual'?'Next, open each person separately. Paste the copied text and tap Send in Messages.':'The installed Shortcut can send after its final confirmation. Launch only from your iPhone. This site cannot verify installation or delivery.')+'</p><button class="primary full" id="start-queue" type="button">'+(mode==='manual'?'Start individual sending':'Prepare iPhone handoff')+'</button><p id="handoff-status" class="status"></p>';$('#start-queue').onclick=begin;$('#review-dialog').showModal();}
function begin(){if(!reviewed)return;const fresh=check();if(fresh.error||JSON.stringify(fresh.phones)!==JSON.stringify(reviewed.phones)||fresh.message!==reviewed.message){$('#review-dialog').close();notify('The draft or recipients changed. Review again.');return;}if(reviewed.mode==='manual'){if(queue&&queue.index<queue.phones.length&&!confirm('Replace the previous reviewed queue? Check Messages first to avoid duplicates.'))return;queue={phones:reviewed.phones,message:reviewed.message,index:0,confirmed:[],skipped:[]};copied=false;opened=false;save();showQueue();update();return;}
const signature=JSON.stringify([reviewed.phones,reviewed.message]);if(handedOff.has(signature)&&!confirm('You already opened this batch. Check Messages before repeating. Prepare again anyway?'))return;
const url='shortcuts://run-shortcut?name=FBC%20Individual%20Texts&input=text&text='+encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(payload(reviewed)));$('#start-queue').hidden=true;const link=document.createElement('a');link.className='button primary full';link.textContent='Open iPhone Shortcut';link.href=url;link.id='shortcut-launch';$('#handoff-status').before(link);link.onclick=e=>{if(!/iPhone|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent)){e.preventDefault();notify('Open this page in Safari on your iPhone. A computer cannot send through your phone.');return;}if(link.dataset.used){e.preventDefault();return;}link.dataset.used='true';handedOff.add(signature);$('#handoff-status').textContent='Handoff requested - NOT a sent confirmation. Check Messages before retrying. No family was marked contacted.';$('#last-status').textContent=$('#handoff-status').textContent;};}
function showQueue(){if(!queue)return;while(queue.index<queue.phones.length&&blocked().has(queue.phones[queue.index])){queue.skipped.push(queue.phones[queue.index]);queue.index++;}opened=false;copied=false;save();update();const el=$('#dialog-content');if(queue.index>=queue.phones.length){el.innerHTML='<div class="eyebrow">QUEUE REVIEW COMPLETE</div><h2 id="dialog-title">You worked through the queue.</h2><p class="small">'+queue.confirmed.length+' manually marked sent; '+queue.skipped.length+' skipped. This is your record, not delivery verification. Confirm actual results in Messages.</p><button class="primary full" id="finish" type="button">Done</button>';$('#finish').onclick=()=>$('#review-dialog').close();return;}
const phone=queue.phones[queue.index],c=directory.find(c=>c.phone===phone);el.innerHTML='<div class="eyebrow">PERSON '+(queue.index+1)+' OF '+queue.phones.length+'</div><h2 id="dialog-title">One person. One conversation.</h2><div class="target"><strong>'+esc(c?c.names.join(' / ')||'Verified guardian':'Pasted number')+'</strong><small>'+esc(c?c.players.join(' / '):'Verify this adult recipient before sending.')+'</small><span>'+esc(format(phone))+'</span></div>'+preview(queue.message)+'<div class="row"><button id="copy-message" type="button">1. Copy message</button><a id="open-messages" class="button primary" href="sms:'+phone+'">2. Open Messages</a></div><p id="copy-status" class="status">Copy the text, open Messages, paste into the message field, verify the number and sending line, then tap Send. Return here afterward.</p><div class="row"><button id="next" class="primary" type="button" disabled>I sent it - next</button><button id="skip" type="button">Skip this person</button></div><p class="small">Opening Messages does not send. Only mark sent after you actually sent the text. Never add other recipients in Messages.</p>';
$('#copy-message').onclick=async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(queue.message);copied=true;$('#copy-status').textContent='Copied. Open Messages, paste into the text field, and tap Send.';}catch{const t=$('#approved-message');t.focus();t.select();try{copied=document.execCommand('copy');}catch{}$('#copy-status').textContent=copied?'Copied. Open Messages and paste.':'Text selected. Use Copy from the iPhone selection menu, then open Messages.';if(!copied)copied=true;}};
$('#open-messages').onclick=e=>{if(!/iPhone|iPod/i.test(navigator.userAgent)){e.preventDefault();notify('Use Safari on your iPhone to open Messages from your personal number.');return;}if(!copied){e.preventDefault();notify('Copy the message first. If automatic copy fails, select the text and use Copy.');return;}opened=true;$('#next').disabled=false;$('#copy-status').textContent='Messages opening requested. Paste and send there. Return here and mark sent only after sending.';save();};
$('#next').onclick=()=>{if(!opened)return;queue.confirmed.push(phone);queue.index++;showQueue();};$('#skip').onclick=()=>{queue.skipped.push(phone);queue.index++;showQueue();};}
$('#directory-count').textContent=directory.length;$('#source-date').textContent=data.dataReady?'Saved database: '+data.updated:'Private contact snapshot not loaded.';
if(!data.dataReady){$('#initial-notice').classList.add('warning');$('#initial-notice').textContent='Your saved contacts are not loaded. You can still paste verified adult numbers below. Do not assume this is the complete database.';}
[...new Set(directory.flatMap(c=>c.grades))].sort((a,b)=>Number(a)-Number(b)).forEach(g=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=g;o.textContent=g==='unknown'?'Unknown':g+'th grade';if(g==='3')o.textContent='3rd grade';$('#grade').append(o);});
try{const prev=load(sessionStorage,KEY);if(prev){$('#message').value=String(prev.message||'').slice(0,2000);$('#manual').value=String(prev.manual||'');(Array.isArray(prev.selected)?prev.selected:[]).map(normalize).filter(Boolean).forEach(n=>selected.add(n));if(prev.queue&&Array.isArray(prev.queue.phones)&&prev.queue.phones.length<=LIMIT&&prev.queue.phones.every(n=>normalize(n)===n)&&typeof prev.queue.message==='string'&&Number.isInteger(prev.queue.index)&&prev.queue.index>=0&&prev.queue.index<=prev.queue.phones.length&&Array.isArray(prev.queue.confirmed)&&Array.isArray(prev.queue.skipped))queue=prev.queue;}}catch{}
$('#search').oninput=renderContacts;$('#grade').onchange=renderContacts;$('#contacts').onchange=e=>{const n=e.target.dataset.phone;if(!n)return;if(e.target.checked)selected.add(n);else selected.delete(n);invalidate();};
$('#select-visible').onclick=()=>{const rows=visible();if(new Set([...selected,...rows.map(c=>c.phone)]).size>LIMIT){notify('Narrow the grade or select individual parents. Limit: '+LIMIT+'.');return;}rows.forEach(c=>selected.add(c.phone));renderContacts();invalidate();};$('#clear').onclick=()=>{selected.clear();$('#manual').value='';renderContacts();invalidate();};$('#message').oninput=invalidate;$('#manual').oninput=invalidate;$('#consent').onchange=update;$('#shortcut-ready').onchange=update;
document.querySelectorAll('[name="mode"]').forEach(r=>r.onchange=()=>{mode=r.value;invalidate();});
const templates={training:'FBC: Reminder - training is [day] at [time], at [location]. Reply here with any questions. - Coach Luke',update:'FBC update: [Write your club announcement here.] Reply here with any questions. - Coach Luke',test:'FBC test message from Coach Luke. This is a test of individual texting.'};document.querySelectorAll('[data-template]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if($('#message').value.trim()&&!confirm('Replace your current draft with this template?'))return;$('#message').value=templates[b.dataset.template];invalidate();});
$('#save-blocked').onclick=()=>{const lines=$('#blocked').value.split(/\r?\n/).filter(s=>s.trim()),bad=lines.filter(s=>!normalize(s));if(bad.length){notify('Fix invalid numbers in your exclusion list first.');return;}localBlocked=[...new Set(lines.map(normalize))];let saved=true;try{localStorage.setItem(BLOCKKEY,JSON.stringify(localBlocked));}catch{saved=false;}blocked().forEach(n=>selected.delete(n));renderContacts();invalidate();notify(saved?'Exclusions saved on this device. Update your master database too.':'Exclusions apply now, but this browser could not save them.');};
$('#review').onclick=review;$('#close-dialog').onclick=()=>$('#review-dialog').close();$('#resume').onclick=()=>{showQueue();$('#review-dialog').showModal();};$('#forget').onclick=()=>{if(!confirm('Clear this session draft and queue? Check Messages first if any texts were started. Saved exclusions will remain.'))return;queue=null;selected.clear();$('#message').value='';$('#manual').value='';renderContacts();invalidate();notify('Session cleared. Your master database was not changed.');};
window.FBCTextTests={normalize,recipients,payload};renderContacts();update();
})();
